WEBVTT

00:30.030 --> 00:32.324
THE PART-TIME JOB BEFORE CHRISTMAS

00:32.408 --> 00:35.536
- <i>The Part-time Job Before Christmas.</i>
- <i>The Part-time Job Before Christmas.</i>

00:44.211 --> 00:46.005
<i>This is Christmas Eve.</i>

00:49.967 --> 00:54.221
<i>Naturally, I'll be spending this holiday
in peace and solitude.</i>

00:56.390 --> 00:58.350
<i>And as for my roommates,</i>

00:58.434 --> 01:02.313
<i>well, they'll be out gallivanting
in new ventures or "love."</i>

01:02.813 --> 01:06.650
<i>Stocking's got this thing for a barber
who's got scissors for hands.</i>

01:06.734 --> 01:08.319
I love it! Take me to bed!

01:09.153 --> 01:13.407
<i>Garterbelt will be getting all chummy
with some burglars who tried to break in.</i>

01:15.159 --> 01:18.954
<i>Dear Sister is currently plagued
with little oddballs that won't let go.</i>

01:19.622 --> 01:22.750
You can cry, you can beg,
but I can't keep all of you!

01:22.833 --> 01:26.462
<i>Panty's obsessed with fucking
this old dude with a beard.</i>

01:26.545 --> 01:27.963
Yes!

01:28.631 --> 01:32.218
<i>And then there's Geek Boy,
the boy perennially obsessed with Panty.</i>

01:32.301 --> 01:37.807
<i>He's been holed up with these robots
he's made to see whether Panty likes him.</i>

01:38.724 --> 01:41.101
Does Panty like me?

01:42.144 --> 01:44.355
- Yes.
- No.

01:44.438 --> 01:45.815
- She loves you.
- Hooray!

01:45.898 --> 01:47.691
- She hates you.
- Oh, no!

01:47.775 --> 01:49.985
Calling dibs on the next guess!

01:51.862 --> 01:55.783
Gunsmith Bitch? What are you doing here?

01:55.866 --> 01:58.869
What am I doing here?
I can kick it wherever I like.

02:00.371 --> 02:03.958
And I was in the mood
for a little shoot-and-see.

02:04.041 --> 02:06.210
Shoot-and-see?
Is that some sort of divination?

02:06.293 --> 02:09.755
The very one and the same
as the voices in the corn fields

02:09.839 --> 02:11.632
in that movie, <i>Field With Dreams</i>.

02:11.715 --> 02:12.800
Huh?

02:12.883 --> 02:15.052
You shoot... and see!

02:16.595 --> 02:18.430
Stop! Wait!

02:18.514 --> 02:21.684
If you profess your love to Panty,
your chances of success are

02:21.767 --> 02:24.895
0.00000000%.

02:24.979 --> 02:28.023
I knew it! I'm not even on Panty's radar!

02:28.107 --> 02:29.108
However!

02:29.191 --> 02:33.279
If you were to profess your love to her
at Lingerie Land, your chances go up to...

02:33.362 --> 02:35.990
0.00000001%!

02:36.073 --> 02:40.286
Whoa! It goes up all that way?
So it's not all just zeroes?

02:40.369 --> 02:42.788
Oh, my God. Yes!

02:42.872 --> 02:45.541
- So? What's Lingerie Land?
- You never got the 411?

02:45.624 --> 02:47.418
It's this totally dope
traveling theme park!

02:47.501 --> 02:50.337
Profess your love to your shorty
at the tip of the Ferris wheel,

02:50.421 --> 02:52.339
and they're bound to return the feels!

02:52.423 --> 02:54.216
You should take Panty on a date there.

02:54.300 --> 02:56.677
A date?

02:57.386 --> 03:00.139
The place is pretty popping,
so it might be hard to nab tickets.

03:00.222 --> 03:03.267
Your chances of even getting a ticket are...

03:03.976 --> 03:05.895
Zero percent!

03:05.978 --> 03:08.689
No way! Not on my watch!
There must be some somewhere.

03:08.772 --> 03:12.401
Plus "Lingerie Land." Plus "Tickets."
"Where to buy now..." Found 'em!

03:12.484 --> 03:14.778
Resale value
is one million Daten City dollars?

03:14.862 --> 03:16.155
Fucking scalpers!

03:16.822 --> 03:21.201
There's a 0.00000001% chance
that Panty will go out with me.

03:21.285 --> 03:22.536
I must have those tickets.

03:22.620 --> 03:24.622
- Well, good luck!
- Tickets! Tickets! I need tickets!

03:24.705 --> 03:25.998
Found some!

03:26.081 --> 03:29.251
Daten City Shopping Mall opens tomorrow,
and they've got tickets up for grabs.

03:29.335 --> 03:33.255
First in line gets to purchase two tickets
to Lingerie Land's New Year Countdown!

03:33.339 --> 03:35.424
That's my in!

03:37.927 --> 03:41.347
<i>I love being alone. No one to please
but myself... pure freedom, pure bliss!</i>

03:41.430 --> 03:46.310
<i>I might even put on my favorite movie,
Cast Terminal Away.</i>

03:47.603 --> 03:50.773
Yes! Yes! Yes!

03:51.523 --> 03:53.609
Nakatomi Building!

03:53.692 --> 03:55.319
Goddamn you, bitch!

03:55.945 --> 03:58.989
Will you put a sock in it?
You're ruining Otm Shank's scene--

03:59.073 --> 04:01.742
'Tis the season for me
to visit good little children.

04:01.825 --> 04:03.994
- Oh, no! I cannot stand!
- What happened here?

04:04.078 --> 04:05.871
I have an important job
to deliver presents

04:05.955 --> 04:08.624
to all the good boys
and girls of the world.

04:08.707 --> 04:10.292
But alas! I have done in my hip.

04:10.376 --> 04:12.127
Not your feet? You're bleeding, you know.

04:12.211 --> 04:14.421
'Tis not a flesh wound.
'Tis but my sexual predilection.

04:16.799 --> 04:18.717
Well, whatever it is,
could you keep it down--

04:18.801 --> 04:22.221
What's this? You volunteer as tribute?
You'll take on my work in my stead?

04:22.304 --> 04:24.390
- I never said--
- Thank you! My Christmas angel!

04:24.473 --> 04:26.100
I'm a demon.

04:26.183 --> 04:28.560
- All I want is peace--
- A red face can only mean good.

04:28.644 --> 04:30.479
Whoever said that
was obviously no red-faced liar!

04:30.562 --> 04:33.357
Good boys and girls of the world,
close your eyes!

04:33.440 --> 04:36.527
Christmas is coming in red tonight
in the form of a beautiful blushing angel!

04:36.610 --> 04:38.988
I'm a demon.
And your hip seems fine to me.

04:45.411 --> 04:48.080
Oh, my God. Santa Claus is not <i>kaiju</i>.

04:50.124 --> 04:55.921
Damn that geezer for busting a hip during
sex and forcing me to do his dirty work.

05:01.260 --> 05:03.554
Not like I had any choice in the matter.

05:03.637 --> 05:06.849
This is all to get my peaceful
holiday in solitude back.

05:16.942 --> 05:17.985
What's this?

05:18.068 --> 05:19.319
Welcome home.

05:19.403 --> 05:21.196
- Kneesocks!
- Fas!

05:21.280 --> 05:22.740
- Welcome back, Kneesocks.
- Chuck.

05:22.823 --> 05:24.950
What happened to all your plans?

05:25.034 --> 05:28.954
He stood me up so he could go
"make it snow" for the one he loves.

05:29.038 --> 05:30.372
What the hell even is that?

05:30.456 --> 05:32.750
Mine split to go rob
some big family mansion

05:32.833 --> 05:36.712
'cause apparently homes get left alone
during the holidays!

05:36.795 --> 05:40.883
Those little fuzz balls were a handful,
so I had them escorted to the pound.

05:40.966 --> 05:43.218
Come now, Kneesocks,
be a dear and sit tight for me.

05:43.302 --> 05:44.887
Yep, I really needed that nap.

05:47.765 --> 05:50.184
- Red-faced angel.
- I'm a demon.

05:50.267 --> 05:54.188
The good boys and girls of the world
will now see their presents and rejoice,

05:54.271 --> 05:57.399
and I can now rise for tomorrow
in jubilation and with arms wide open!

05:57.483 --> 05:58.901
And it's all thanks to you.

05:58.984 --> 06:01.320
Perfect. Can you leave now?

06:01.403 --> 06:02.863
Ho, ho! This is for you.

06:02.946 --> 06:06.825
For the good girl who believed in me
and volunteered her time for me.

06:12.081 --> 06:13.665
Gotta blitz! Gotta dash!

06:16.585 --> 06:18.504
It's been a long day.

06:20.297 --> 06:22.508
- Merry Christmas.
- Merry Christmas.

06:23.759 --> 06:28.472
I lost out on those tickets at the mall,
and they're sold out everywhere else.

06:28.555 --> 06:31.975
I'll never find tickets
to Lingerie Land now.

06:32.059 --> 06:34.812
I thought guys were more into
<i>Mjalnir: Love and Santa</i> these days.

06:34.895 --> 06:37.773
I am thoroughly exhausted
from running around all day.

06:37.856 --> 06:39.191
Me too.

06:39.900 --> 06:43.278
- You guys should Christmas fuck, like me.
- We're not debauched whores like you.

06:44.988 --> 06:46.698
Hey, Chuck. What are you eating?

06:46.782 --> 06:48.242
Hey, that's my--

06:49.201 --> 06:53.664
Are those Lingerie Land tickets?

06:53.747 --> 06:56.667
And not just any old
Lingerie Land tickets.

06:56.750 --> 07:00.337
Those are some goddamn family tickets
for Lingerie Land's New Year Countdown!

07:03.757 --> 07:05.926
Well, shall we all go together?

07:06.009 --> 07:08.345
- Really?
- Wait, I mean--

07:08.428 --> 07:11.056
Oh, my God. Yes!

07:11.890 --> 07:13.517
Thank you, Kneesocks!
A thousand thank-yous!

07:14.393 --> 07:15.769
Do you think they'll have sweets?

07:15.853 --> 07:17.479
Don't know what all the fuss is about,

07:17.563 --> 07:20.232
but hell, let's all spend New Year's
at Lingerie Land together!

07:20.315 --> 07:25.362
Are you sure about this?
Do we really want such vulgar company?

07:25.445 --> 07:26.864
Who's vulgar?

07:26.947 --> 07:29.533
I'm so happy!

07:43.672 --> 07:47.843
Well, I guess not all Christmases
need to be spent in solitude.

07:48.510 --> 07:50.971
- Merry Christmas!
- Merry Christmas!

07:58.979 --> 08:01.315
HEAVEN WARS
EPISODE ONE - THE FAMILY MENACE

08:01.398 --> 08:04.026
- <i>Heaven Wars, Episode one.</i>
- <i>Heaven Wars, Episode one.</i>

08:04.109 --> 08:06.403
- <i>The Family Menace.</i>
- <i>The Family Menace.</i>

08:08.989 --> 08:10.949
Chuck, chuck, chuck...

08:18.415 --> 08:22.252
We have been blessed with a mandate
direct from Linière, the King of Heaven.

08:22.336 --> 08:23.337
From Daddy?

08:23.420 --> 08:27.049
Daddy? You guys are royalty?

08:27.132 --> 08:28.258
You didn't know?

08:28.342 --> 08:30.135
And he's not just any old king.

08:30.219 --> 08:33.138
He is the King of all the gods
who reside in Heaven.

08:33.222 --> 08:34.389
He is the God of all gods.

08:34.473 --> 08:36.767
He is King of Gods.

08:36.850 --> 08:40.938
- God? Panty's dad is God?
- Burp.

08:41.021 --> 08:43.440
Which means
if I profess my love for Panty,

08:43.523 --> 08:45.275
and if we do start going out,

08:45.359 --> 08:48.362
and if we keep dating to the point
where I get to go and meet her parents...

08:48.445 --> 08:50.697
If all of that is to come,

08:50.781 --> 08:54.201
that means I'll get to meet God!

08:54.284 --> 08:57.829
So what does the King of Heaven
want all of a sudden?

08:57.913 --> 09:00.540
He wants you to come home immediately.

09:01.416 --> 09:04.211
"By the powers vested in me by Heaven,

09:04.294 --> 09:08.840
I grant my daughters, Panty and Stocking,
temporary homecoming visas.

09:08.924 --> 09:10.300
But please, no presents.

09:10.384 --> 09:14.638
From your beloved father, Linière,
aka, the King of Gods."

09:14.721 --> 09:16.223
- Huh.
- Chuck.

09:16.306 --> 09:19.351
Fickle old fart. First he banishes us,
now he begs us back with open arms.

09:19.434 --> 09:22.145
Why would he want us back all of a sudden?

09:22.229 --> 09:24.648
Who knows?
We'll just have to go and find out.

09:24.731 --> 09:26.608
All right. Change of plans.

09:26.692 --> 09:29.569
We'll be spending New Year's in Heaven.

09:29.653 --> 09:30.862
No! Wait!

09:30.946 --> 09:33.991
I thought we were all gonna spend
New Year's together at Lingerie Land?

09:34.074 --> 09:36.451
But Daddy's telling us to come home.

09:36.535 --> 09:40.580
Then you go, Stocking! Go by yourself!

09:40.664 --> 09:42.457
I'm going with Panty to--

09:42.541 --> 09:44.376
- Huh?
- Chuck.

09:44.459 --> 09:45.961
Fine, fine.

09:46.044 --> 09:47.587
Let's all go to Heaven.

09:47.671 --> 09:49.506
Huh? Heaven?

09:49.589 --> 09:52.009
Does this mean Panty
wants to take me to her Heavenly father?

09:52.092 --> 09:55.053
Who also just so happens to be
the real Heavenly Father?

09:55.137 --> 09:57.931
And I haven't even
professed my love for her yet?

09:58.015 --> 09:59.933
I'm moving on up so fast!

10:00.017 --> 10:03.729
Then we can all go
to Lingerie Land when we get back.

10:03.812 --> 10:05.314
Hey! You listening, Geek Boy?

10:06.440 --> 10:08.650
Yes! I'll come!

10:08.734 --> 10:10.736
Do ya think we could tag along?

10:10.819 --> 10:11.945
- Even demons?
- Even demons?

10:12.029 --> 10:13.447
Sure, why not?

10:13.530 --> 10:17.576
We are the best and brightest daughters
of the almighty King of Gods.

10:17.659 --> 10:21.079
A name drop from us
is bound to get you in anywhere.

10:24.875 --> 10:26.126
Look after the house, y'hear?

10:26.209 --> 10:27.210
Chuck.

10:27.294 --> 10:29.629
I'm entrusting all housekeeping duties
to you.

10:29.713 --> 10:31.089
Fas!

10:31.173 --> 10:33.550
Hey, Panty...

10:34.176 --> 10:36.053
- What?
- Shall I take your luggage?

10:36.136 --> 10:37.471
I'm not taking any.

10:37.554 --> 10:40.849
I'm just going home for the holidays.
What could I possibly take with me?

10:42.351 --> 10:45.187
That's a lot of luggage
for only a few days.

10:45.270 --> 10:47.022
What on earth did you pack?

10:47.105 --> 10:51.193
Just a little bribe or two
to get into the Big Man's good books.

10:51.276 --> 10:53.904
This right here is the sum
of my hopes and dreams.

10:53.987 --> 10:56.323
It's my one-way ticket
to bigger things in a zipper!

10:56.406 --> 10:57.407
I see.

10:57.491 --> 10:59.034
Hey, what's that?

11:00.160 --> 11:02.454
Is this bus gonna take us to Heaven?

11:03.121 --> 11:05.540
- Get in, loser. We're going to Heaven.
- Wait, Panty!

11:18.470 --> 11:20.055
<i>This is my chance.</i>

11:20.138 --> 11:22.933
<i>I'll show Panty just how cool I can be.</i>

11:23.016 --> 11:26.645
<i>And then I'm going to profess
my love for her at Lingerie Land.</i>

11:30.273 --> 11:31.942
What in the Heavens is this?

11:32.025 --> 11:34.694
It's kinda like the border
between Heaven and Earth.

11:35.612 --> 11:36.655
Passport.

11:36.738 --> 11:38.198
We need our passports?

11:38.281 --> 11:40.283
You didn't tell us to bring those.

11:40.367 --> 11:41.868
It's fine. I got this.

11:43.078 --> 11:46.873
Hey, hon. Great work you're doin' here.
I'm Panty. The King of the Gods' daughter.

11:46.957 --> 11:48.208
Passport.

11:48.291 --> 11:50.669
The King of Gods, Linière.
You know him, right?

11:50.752 --> 11:52.045
Passport.

11:52.129 --> 11:56.007
I'm his daughter, and this is my crew.
The King of Gods' daughter. Panty.

11:56.091 --> 11:57.509
Got it? So let us through.

11:57.592 --> 11:58.885
Passport.

11:58.969 --> 12:01.221
Hey, man, I thought we had a deal.

12:01.304 --> 12:02.305
Fuck!

12:02.931 --> 12:06.059
I thought I heard
some basic-bitch voice grating in my ears.

12:06.143 --> 12:07.853
I was right. It's the sisters.

12:08.353 --> 12:11.398
Did you really think you'd get through
Heaven's Border with just some clout?

12:11.481 --> 12:13.024
Hey, it's the Poly Peeps!

12:13.108 --> 12:14.776
What circus let you freaks wander off?

12:14.860 --> 12:18.780
Isn't it obvious? We're here to help,
so you can just let us cook.

12:18.864 --> 12:22.659
"Daughters of the King of Heaven,
Pantiel and Stockiel,

12:22.742 --> 12:25.287
and any Heavenly affiliates
are hereby granted access to Heaven."

12:25.370 --> 12:28.665
As officially decreed
by Secretary of Heaven Ramie.

12:31.126 --> 12:32.252
Go.

12:33.587 --> 12:34.588
Really?

12:35.380 --> 12:38.049
Thanks for the contribution,
but we had that on our own.

12:38.800 --> 12:39.843
Then let us be off.

12:41.094 --> 12:42.554
Are you a heavenly affiliate?

12:43.138 --> 12:45.390
He's a priest.
That affiliate enough for ya?

12:45.474 --> 12:47.434
I guess we're next.

12:48.727 --> 12:50.896
Are you also affiliates?

12:50.979 --> 12:52.731
They're our maids.

12:52.814 --> 12:54.983
We live together. Isn't that enough?

12:55.734 --> 12:57.736
Maids? Us? To some silly angels?

12:59.070 --> 13:00.280
We're demo--

13:01.948 --> 13:02.991
Shush!

13:03.074 --> 13:04.618
And me?

13:05.785 --> 13:06.870
What about him?

13:07.537 --> 13:09.664
- Sister...
- Him?

13:11.625 --> 13:12.626
He's a geek.

13:13.460 --> 13:14.711
He's just a Geek Boy.

13:17.130 --> 13:19.132
Then he is not affiliated.

13:23.094 --> 13:24.721
How could you?

13:24.804 --> 13:25.805
- Get back!
- Get back!

13:25.889 --> 13:29.726
You are no affiliate.
You're just a Geek Boy.

13:30.519 --> 13:32.437
Wait, Panty!

13:32.521 --> 13:36.107
You guys! Take me to Heaven with you!

13:36.191 --> 13:38.527
The path to Heaven for you
demands your death.

13:38.610 --> 13:41.321
Only the dead have free entry to Heaven.

13:41.404 --> 13:43.532
Will you die here?
Or will you go back to Earth?

13:43.615 --> 13:44.616
Make your choice.

13:44.699 --> 13:46.993
"Just a Geek Boy."

13:48.119 --> 13:49.454
How could you...

14:01.049 --> 14:03.802
Damn, so this is the royal crib
where God rules over Heaven?

14:03.885 --> 14:07.055
What garish taste. Not fabulous at all.

14:07.138 --> 14:09.307
You took the words
right out of my mouth, Dear Sister.

14:09.391 --> 14:12.310
Panty! Stocking! My, how you've grown!

14:12.394 --> 14:15.021
I look away for one second
and I see you're now sprouting horns.

14:15.105 --> 14:17.274
- Dear, our children are over here.
- I knew that.

14:17.357 --> 14:19.985
Welcome home, Panty and Stocking.

14:20.068 --> 14:22.237
- Hi, Daddy.
- Hi, Mommy.

14:22.737 --> 14:26.992
Praise be, King of Gods, Linière,
and Queen Silk. It is truly my pleasure.

14:27.492 --> 14:29.953
So why'd you call us back?
Did something happen?

14:30.036 --> 14:32.038
Yes. Take a gander at this.

14:32.998 --> 14:38.128
"Husband and wife, King Linière and
Queen Silk, caught in a double affair."

14:38.211 --> 14:41.339
Those rotten journalists
at the Heaven Paparazzi caught us.

14:41.423 --> 14:43.508
They "caught" all these?

14:43.592 --> 14:44.843
You losers!

14:46.469 --> 14:50.015
I thought everyone knew
you guys were mad swingers?

14:50.098 --> 14:51.182
I know right?

14:52.517 --> 14:53.518
Ahem.

14:53.602 --> 14:57.772
Well, this time around,
it's no laughing matter.

14:57.856 --> 14:59.774
A handful of tiny little scandals

14:59.858 --> 15:03.194
and all of a sudden the people
no longer see me as their radiant sun!

15:03.278 --> 15:07.657
According to the latest Heaven's Poll,
my approval rating's sunk to a mere 0.1%!

15:07.741 --> 15:10.660
Why, one could expect
a coup d'état to occur at any moment.

15:10.744 --> 15:11.911
Which leads me to...

15:12.621 --> 15:14.789
Panty, Stocking,

15:14.873 --> 15:19.127
let me abdicate,
and you guys become King of the Gods.

15:20.337 --> 15:23.089
You are young, and you're hot.

15:23.173 --> 15:26.134
And even two fallen angels
are seen as a step up from your father,

15:26.217 --> 15:28.345
at least according
to the latest independent polls.

15:28.428 --> 15:32.891
I want you to assume the throne while
the seat's still warm before I am ousted.

15:32.974 --> 15:36.436
- It'll go over well with the youth--
- Why am I lower than you?

15:36.519 --> 15:39.397
And that'll surely score me
some brownie points!

15:39.481 --> 15:41.900
You must rescue the family name.

15:41.983 --> 15:44.819
Panty, Stocking, we're counting on you.

15:44.903 --> 15:46.821
- Seriously?
- Seriously?

15:48.365 --> 15:51.242
He's a geek. He's just a Geek Boy.

15:52.160 --> 15:54.079
You're too cruel, Panty.

15:54.162 --> 15:56.665
Hey, you heard the latest about Linière?

15:56.748 --> 15:59.167
- Isn't Linière Panty's dad?
- The double affair scandal, right?

15:59.250 --> 16:03.630
If disgrace was enough to dethrone him,
he'd have been gone six scandals ago.

16:03.713 --> 16:07.842
Don't tell anyone, but...

16:07.926 --> 16:09.552
Oh, my God. Are you for real?

16:09.636 --> 16:10.637
Who's there?

16:10.720 --> 16:12.681
It's him! It's "Just a Geek Boy"!

16:12.764 --> 16:13.890
Uh-oh!

16:18.436 --> 16:20.021
Panty and Stocking.

16:20.105 --> 16:23.024
You're the only ones
who can save this family.

16:23.108 --> 16:24.526
You must save our name!

16:24.609 --> 16:27.028
Are you fucking kidding me?
Since when were we "family"?

16:27.112 --> 16:29.531
All you want is for us
to do your damage control for you.

16:29.614 --> 16:32.534
You wanna save face?
It's gonna take more than an abdication.

16:32.617 --> 16:37.122
Come now, become the rulers
and you can do anything as you wish.

16:37.205 --> 16:39.165
Anything? Get fucked.

16:39.249 --> 16:40.417
Let's blow this joint.

16:43.420 --> 16:45.004
Hi, Ramie.

16:45.088 --> 16:47.841
Ramie! What perfect timing.
Go on, you tell them.

16:47.924 --> 16:50.093
It would be my pleasure.

16:50.802 --> 16:52.762
Leave it all to me...

16:55.765 --> 16:58.727
- What's this?
- What's going on?

16:58.810 --> 17:01.563
- Scanty! Kneesocks!
- Garter!

17:03.022 --> 17:05.567
Unauthorized demons
found attempting to sneak into Heaven.

17:05.650 --> 17:06.818
And a human.

17:07.444 --> 17:09.779
King Linière, or rather, Brother Linière.

17:09.863 --> 17:14.242
Your daughters just tried to smuggle
demons, of all things, into Heaven.

17:14.325 --> 17:15.368
You backstabbing bastard!

17:15.452 --> 17:18.246
Aren't you the one
who let us all in with that note?

17:18.329 --> 17:23.376
I granted access to Panty and Stocking
and any Heavenly affiliates.

17:23.460 --> 17:26.755
What affiliation could demons
possibly have with Heaven?

17:26.838 --> 17:29.507
And if you really are
affiliated with demons,

17:29.591 --> 17:31.968
then that, my dears, is a mortal sin.

17:32.051 --> 17:36.181
It would seem your family's descent
into depravity truly is limitless.

17:36.264 --> 17:40.894
With a father-daughter duo like this,
Heaven is sure to fall from grace.

17:40.977 --> 17:44.105
So I will not allow you
to take the throne.

17:44.189 --> 17:47.942
Instead, I will be the King
to rule over all the gods.

17:48.026 --> 17:51.946
You? My brother? King of Gods?

17:56.993 --> 17:59.162
You've always been a funny one.

17:59.245 --> 18:02.040
The third in line to the throne
wants to become king?

18:02.123 --> 18:03.333
Third!

18:03.875 --> 18:05.585
Third in line?

18:07.962 --> 18:11.257
Heaven's fall from grace
is all your doing, Brother.

18:11.341 --> 18:14.761
It's a damned free-for-all
among the gods and the angels out there.

18:14.844 --> 18:17.722
If you won't control them, I will.

18:17.806 --> 18:20.266
I will bring the gods back in line.

18:22.435 --> 18:24.813
The runt of the family? The third in line?

18:24.896 --> 18:26.397
You're too funny.

18:28.316 --> 18:30.276
Brother Linière.

18:30.360 --> 18:35.114
I beg of you. Allow me, Ramie,
to ascend the throne of Heaven.

18:36.866 --> 18:39.077
All right, all right already!

18:39.160 --> 18:40.995
Cut it out with the jokes already!

18:41.704 --> 18:45.291
It's been a pleasure, my foolish brother.

18:46.125 --> 18:50.547
<i>King Linière's voice added
to the Throne Succession papers.</i>

18:50.630 --> 18:52.298
<i>All right, all right already!</i>

18:52.382 --> 18:53.758
What?

18:53.842 --> 18:58.596
<i>Ramie, formerly third in line,
will now inherit the throne.</i>

19:02.475 --> 19:04.102
The God of Halo!

19:04.185 --> 19:05.395
You can't!

19:10.191 --> 19:12.527
Bow your head, Linière.

19:12.610 --> 19:17.532
You stand before the King of Gods!

19:20.535 --> 19:22.036
- Daddy!
- Mommy!

19:37.176 --> 19:38.261
I know this place!

19:42.223 --> 19:43.516
Hey, Brief, my boy.

19:43.600 --> 19:45.768
You're just in time for
<i>Dances With Wolves</i>.

19:45.852 --> 19:48.354
I was just about to settle down
for the extended edition.

19:48.438 --> 19:50.356
Wanna veg out and watch it with me?

19:50.440 --> 19:53.902
I don't have time to waste
on that fucking slog of a film!

19:57.030 --> 19:58.323
So basically,

19:58.948 --> 20:03.202
this Ramie guy's got Panty and the gang
in this big choke hold up in Heaven?

20:03.286 --> 20:05.330
Yes! We have to save them!

20:06.497 --> 20:10.418
But I'm just a Geek Boy.
What could I possibly have to offer?

20:10.501 --> 20:13.129
I wouldn't say that.
Yo, what a gnarly turn of events!

20:13.212 --> 20:15.006
Little old Geek Boy flipping the script

20:15.089 --> 20:17.300
and becoming the hero
to save his damsel in distress.

20:17.383 --> 20:20.053
Why, it's just like in the movies,
and it's Totes McGoats cool.

20:21.137 --> 20:22.221
Really?

20:22.972 --> 20:26.935
Your chances of Panty falling for you
if you become her hero are...

20:30.146 --> 20:34.609
0.000000000001%.

20:34.692 --> 20:37.487
No way! That's also higher than zero!

20:37.570 --> 20:40.239
So Panty might actually fall for me?

20:40.323 --> 20:42.951
All right then! Just you wait, Panty.
I'm gonna come and rescue you!

20:43.910 --> 20:47.413
But I can't.
Only the dead can get into Heaven.

20:47.497 --> 20:50.041
- I could help you croak?
- You can do that?

20:50.124 --> 20:52.794
This drink will hit
the pause button on your vitals.

20:52.877 --> 20:56.214
Basically, it'll seem like you're dead,
so it'll get you past the pearly gates.

20:56.297 --> 21:01.344
But you gotta come back within 24 hours,
or else you'll flatline for good.

21:01.427 --> 21:05.139
Got it. I've got 24 hours to save Panty
and come back home.

21:05.223 --> 21:06.516
And it's dangerous to go alone.

21:11.437 --> 21:12.438
Chuck!

21:12.522 --> 21:15.400
Chuck! Are you gonna die with me?

21:15.483 --> 21:16.484
Chuck, chuck!

21:16.567 --> 21:17.902
Let's go, partner!

21:19.112 --> 21:22.490
Brief and Chuck, together again!

21:24.951 --> 21:26.369
Catch you on the flip side!

21:29.998 --> 21:31.290
You moldy asswipe!

21:31.374 --> 21:34.752
Well then, let's get started, shall we?

22:03.406 --> 22:05.408
Now the gods

22:05.491 --> 22:07.160
shall be as one!

23:37.792 --> 23:39.794
Subtitle: Rychelle Brittain
